Koun Sughra ka uthayega janaza bhaiyya,<br>
Ghutke marjaye jo furqat mein mariza bhaiyya.<br>
<br>
Meri baba se sifarish nahi karta koi,<br>
Shahe wala se guzarish nahi karta koi,<br>
Sabko lejate hain juz Fatima Sughra bhaiyya.<br>
<br>
Apni bemaar behen ko na rulao Akber,<br>
Haal baba ko mera jake batao Akber,<br>
Apki baat nahi taalte Moula bhaiyya.<br>
<br>
Koun masoom Sakina ne yeh farmaya hai,<br>
Nannhe Asgher ka bhi ferist mein naam aaya hai,<br>
Bas nahi hai to faqat naam hamara bhaiyya.<br>
<br>
Sir jhukaye hue chup chap khade ho Akber,<br>
Aur udhar laqte safar baandh chuke hain Sarwar,<br>
Ab toh baba se kaho jake Khudara bhaiyya.<br>
<br>
Haye ab girya-o-nala na karongi lekin,<br>
Aur tumse koi shikwa na karongi lekin,<br>
Mere jeene ki duaein nahi karna bhaiyya.<br>
<br>
Karbala ka hai irada yehi sab kehte hain,<br>
Woh zameen thik nahi ahle Arab kehte hain,<br>
Dar hai ghirjaye musibat mein na baba bhaiyya.<br>
<br>
Shahe wala ki chaheeti hoon dulari hoon mein,<br>
Yeh alag baat ki taqdeer ki mari hoon mein,<br>
Mere baba ko masayeb se bachana bhaiyya.<br>
<br>
Jab bhi ghurbat se Sakina ko watan yaad aaye,<br>
Meri behna ko jo bimaar behen yaad aaye,<br>
Tab bada royenge tum dena dilasa bhaiyya.<br>
<br>
Ali Akber meri furqat tumhein tadpayegi,<br>
Tum jo ro-oge tabhi yaad meri ghabrayegi,<br>
Yaad karke mujhe rona na rulana bhaiyya.<br>
<br>
Manzile saaj mein chehre pe udasi na rahe,<br>
Meri masoom Sakina kahin pyasi na rahe,<br>
Mere hisse ka bhi tum pyaar nibhana bhaiyya.<br>
<br>
Jald baba ki dua dulha banayegi tumhe,<br>
Ek bemaar behen yaad toh ayegi tumhe,<br>
Sabr karna meri qatir na tadapna bhaiyya.<br>
<br>
Khudko gar dashte qaza toh na bacha payi mein,<br>
Aur shadi mein tumhari toh na aa payi mein,<br>
Tum mera nek meri qabr pe lana bhaiyya.<br>
<br>
Waqte matam hai 'Hasan' aur qalb mashk baqa,<br>
Alweda kehti hai bhai ko behen wawela,<br>
Lab pe naara hai mujhe bhul na jana bhaiyya...